  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx = √3 + √2\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a + b)² = a² + b² + 2ab\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n⇒ x² = (√3 + √2)²\n\n⇒ = 3 + 2 + 2√6\n\n⇒ = 5 + 2√6\n\nNow,\n\n⇒ x² − 2√6 = (5 + 2√6) − 2√6\n\n⇒ = 5\n\n**∴ Answer = 5**",
